Scope

This licence covers the source code of this project only: the recompiler
(tools/), the runtime (runtime/), the settings program and disk image reader
(launcher/) and the install scripts.

It does NOT cover:
- DuckTales: The Quest for Gold itself, or anything made from it (the game
  files, disk images, the disassembly, the generated C code in gen/ and any
  compiled ducktales executable). The game is copyright (c) 1990 Disney /
  Titus / Incredible Technologies.
- Third-party components, which keep their own licences (see licenses/):
  SDL2 (zlib), the SPS decoder library CAPSImg (non-commercial use only),
  font8x8 (public domain).
